INSERT INTO `QuizQuestions` VALUES (1,101,'What is 2 + 2?','{\"A\": \"3\", \"B\": \"4\", \"C\": \"5\", \"D\": \"6\"}','B','Mathematics','10th','easy','manual','en','2026-02-28 14:48:11','2026-02-28 14:48:11'),(2,102,'Which gas do plants absorb for photosynthesis?','{\"A\": \"Oxygen\", \"B\": \"Nitrogen\", \"C\": \"Carbon Dioxide\", \"D\": \"Helium\"}','C','Biology','9th','easy','manual','en','2026-02-28 14:48:11','2026-02-28 14:48:11'),(3,103,'If sin θ = 1/2, what is θ in degrees within 0° to 180°?','{\"A\": \"30\", \"B\": \"45\", \"C\": \"60\", \"D\": \"90\"}','A','Mathematics','10th','medium','manual','en','2026-02-28 14:48:11','2026-02-28 14:48:11'),(4,1,'sinA and cosA are opposite in sign where cosA = - \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\n In which quardrant the angle A lie?','{\"A\": \"First\", \"B\": \"Secoand\", \"C\": \"Third\", \"D\": \"Fourth\"}','B','Math-II','10th','medium','10th-Math-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:42','2026-04-18 10:13:42'),(5,2,'What is the value of cosecA?','{\"A\": \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\", \"B\": \"- \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\", \"C\": \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\", \"D\": \"#ERROR!\"}','C','Math-II','10th','medium','10th-Math-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:42','2026-04-18 10:13:42'),(6,3,'Which is the sum of the given infinite geometric series?\n \\sqrt{3} + 1 + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}} + \\cdots','{\"A\": \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{3} - 1}\", \"B\": \"\\\\sqrt{3} - 1\", \"C\": \"\\\\frac{2\\\\sqrt{3}}{\\\\sqrt{3} - 1}\", \"D\": \"\\\\frac{3}{1 - \\\\sqrt{3}}\"}','A','Math-II','10th','medium','10th-Math-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:42','2026-04-18 10:13:42'),(7,4,'\\frac{1}{2x + 1} + \\frac{1}{(2x + 1)^{2}} + \\frac{1}{(2x + 1)^{3}} + \\cdots is an infinite geometric series. For which value of x that we can determine sum of the infinite series?','{\"A\": \"x<0 or x< - 1\", \"B\": \"x>0 or x< - 1\", \"C\": \"x<0 or x> - 1\", \"D\": \"x>0 or x> - 1\"}','B','Math-II','10th','medium','