w?','{\"A\": \"\\\\frac{N}{\\\\theta - \\\\theta_{ice}} = \\\\frac{X_{\\\\theta} - X_{ice}}{X_{steam} - X_{ice}}\", \"B\": \"\\\\frac{\\\\theta - \\\\theta_{ice}}{N} = \\\\frac{X_{\\\\theta} - X_{ice}}{X_{steam} - X_{ice}}\", \"C\": \"\\\\frac{N}{\\\\theta - \\\\theta_{ice}} = \\\\frac{X_{steam} - X_{ice}{X_{\\\\theta} - X_{ice}}}\", \"D\": \"\\\\frac{\\\\theta - \\\\theta_{ice}}{N} = \\\\frac{X_{steam} - X_{ice}}{X_{\\\\theta} - X_{ice}}\"}','B','Physics-II','12th','medium','12th-Physics-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:47','2026-04-18 10:13:47'),(1246,1243,'X \\xarrowright{\\beta} Y \\xarrowright{\\alpha} Z \\xrightarrow{\\gamma} M\n [Where \\alpha , \\beta and \\gamma are the emitted particles from X, Y and Z elements respectively. The mass number of the element M is 210 and its atomic number is 82.]\n \n What is the atomic number of the elementry?','{\"A\": \"84\", \"B\": \"82\", \"C\": \"80\", \"D\": \"78\"}','A','Physics-II','12th','medium','12th-Physics-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:47','2026-04-18 10:13:47'),(1247,1244,'X \\xarrowright{\\beta} Y \\xarrowright{\\alpha} Z \\xrightarrow{\\gamma} M\n [Where \\alpha , \\beta and \\gamma are the emitted particles from X, Y and Z elements respectively. The mass number of the element M is 210 and its atomic number is 82.]\n \n X and Y elements of the stem are-','{\"A\": \"Isobar\", \"B\": \"Isotone\", \"C\": \"Isotope\", \"D\": \"Isomer\"}','A','Physics-II','12th','medium','12th-Physics-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:47','2026-04-18 10:13:47'),(1248,1245,'What is unit of entropy?','{\"A\": \"NK^{-1}\", \"B\": \"JK^{-1}\", \"C\": \"JK^{-1} mol^{-1}\", \"D\": \"N^{-1} m^{-2} C^{2}\"}','B','Physics-II','12th','medium','12th-Physics-II.csv','en','2026-04-18 10:13:47','2026-04-18 10:13:47'),(1249,1246,'The decisions of the Michelson Morley\'s experiments are-\n i. there is no any either medium in this universe\n ii. Galilian transformation is right\n iii. the velocity of light is constant, that is not dependable of any ob